  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List I and List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 600px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>Gauss&rsquo;s Law in&nbsp;Electrostatics&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8750;</mo><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msub><mi>&#981;</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>Faraday&#39;s Law</td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8750;</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>Gauss&rsquo;s Law in Magnetism</td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8750;</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mover><mi>l</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msub><mi>&#981;</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>Ampere-Maxwell Law</td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8750;</mo><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mover><mi>s</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>q</mi><msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>"
